  "notes": "Official cause_code is TBD/provisional per FORM-366 fields; narrative describes an invalid protective relay actuation (equipment) triggering a procedural response (personnel/procedure) that briefly rendered both emergency power paths inoperable concurrently. No block_13 rows were provided (N/A in source). CT-4 is part of the Underground Emergency Power Path per narrative but not explicitly stated as failing itself -- included as a component reference; KHS units did not actuate since no loss of AC power occurred, so KHS modeled as available/backup context rather than an activated failure path. Duration of the reportable loss-of-safety-function condition is the 1-minute underground path inoperability window (1050-1051 EST); full CT-3 restoration took until 1651 EST but that is total repair time, not the loss-of-safety-function duration."
